==Armor==
As a hero, Devona starts with Devona's armor, which has its own unique appearance. Her armor has an [[armor rating]] of 35 to 80, depending on her level. Like all heroes, her headgear provides an additional +1 attribute bonus based on the rune applied to it.

Like [[M.O.X.]], her armor cannot be upgraded.

