|'''[[Guild Wars Factions|Factions]]'''
|-
|
;Kaineng City towns and outposts
:''"When I was a child, my father used to tell me great tales of passing over the Shiverpeaks when he served with Ascalon's Chosen. My father would never believe I came all the way to [[Cantha]] to help fight a war against this great [[Afflicted|plague]]. I hope he can see me from the mists and is proud of me. Every enemy crushed beneath my hammer is another tribute to his memory."''

;Echovald Forest towns and outposts
:''"Just look at the beauty the Kurzicks have brought into this forest. It's no wonder they protect it from the Luxons. Enough talk, we should look to the task at hand."''

;Divine Path
:''"It was a tough fight, was it not?"''
|}

{| class="collapsible" style="margin-left: 0em; margin-top: 0em; width: 450px;" cellspacing="0"
