== Notes ==
* Devona is one of the only five characters to appear in all 3 campaigns and the expansion (the others are Aidan, Cynn, Eve, and Mhenlo).
* She is the only character available as both a hero and henchman. You can include her in your party in both roles at the same time. She will appear under her own name for both.
* Her personality appears to change as throughout the campaigns: her noble and honorable edge diminishes during ''Factions'' and she develops more attitude during ''Nightfall''. Some consider her character to have the most well-developed personality in the ''Guild Wars'' universe.
* She is labeled as a "[[Fighter Henchman]]".
* She appears in many ''Guild Wars'' [[Stories]].
* When unlocked as a hero, she wields [[Devona's Foehammer]].
* A duplicate Devona hero will show up as an "Ascalonian Warrior".

{{anomaly|Devona can appear both a hero and a henchman or ally in the same map without the hero's name changing.}}

== Trivia ==
{{gw2w|Herald of Balthazar|Devona}}
* Devona's quote "I've hammered all over this land" is a paraphrase of [https://genius.com/Pete-seeger-if-i-had-a-hammer-lyrics the lyrics] of [[W:If I Had a Hammer|If I Had a Hammer]] by [[W:Pete Seeger|Pete Seeger]] and [[w:Lee Hays|Lee Hays]].
* The quote "A flesh wound? You've managed only to anger me." is an exaggeration of the line "It's just a flesh wound." from the movie [[w:Monty_Python_and_the_Holy_Grail|Monty Python and the Holy Grail]], also referenced by a [["It's Just a Flesh Wound."|Paragon skill]].
* She wields a [[Foehammer]] in the game, but in the early Guild Wars lore and concept art, she is depicted and described as a [[sword]] warrior. Additionally, in the opening cinematic of the ''Prophecies'' campaign, she is shown to be dual-wielding a pair of swords.
* Her henchman skills were updated in the [[Game updates/20091022|October 22, 2009]] and [[Feedback:Game updates/20100311|March 11, 2010 updates]] (the latter only updated her Factions skillset).
** Prophecies: This added [[Balanced Stance]], [["To the Limit!"]], and [[Earthshaker]] (elite), and removed [["Charge!"]] (elite) from her skills. 
** Factions: This added [[Enraged Smash]] (elite), [[Yeti Smash]], and [[Balanced Stance]], and removed [[Irresistible Blow]] and [["Charge!"]] (elite) from her skills. 
*** The March 11, 2010 update added [[Staggering Blow]] and removed [[Mighty Blow]] from her skills. 
** Nightfall: This added [[Magehunter's Smash]] (elite), [[Mokele Smash]], [[Balanced Stance]], and [[Lion's Comfort]] and removed [[Healing Signet]] and [["Charge!"]] (elite) from her skills. 
** Eye of the North: This added [[Crushing Blow]], [[Lion's Comfort]], and [[Plague Touch]], and removed [[Irresistible Blow]] and [[Healing Signet]] from her skills. 
* Devona was made a hero in the [[Feedback:Game updates/20260401| April 1, 2026]] content update.
* She is one of five heroes to have an elite as one of her default skills, the others being the [[Ghost of Althea]], [[Keiran Thackeray]], [[Miku]], and [[Zei Ri]].
* She, the [[Ghost of Althea]], and [[Zei Ri]] are the only heroes without an [[Everlasting Tonic]].

